---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="CSR Overview - Sustainability" 
  description="Overview of Corporate Social Responsibility (CSR) initiatives at JKSPDC."
>
  <div class="space-y-0 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
    <!-- Premium Page Header Band -->
    <div class="page-header-band animate-fadeInUp">
      <nav class="breadcrumb-trail" aria-label="Breadcrumbs">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span class="separator">/</span>
        <span>About Us</span>
        <span class="separator">/</span>
        <span class="current">CSR</span>
      </nav>
      <h1>CSR — Corporate Social Responsibility</h1>
      <p class="page-subtitle">Jammu &amp; Kashmir State Power Development Corporation Limited (JKSPDCL)</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Content -->
    <div class="animate-fadeInUp delay-200">
      <!-- Main Text -->
      <article class="prose-gov w-full">
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          JKSPDC prioritizes local community welfare, infrastructure development, and education around its hydroelectric projects through focused CSR initiatives.
        </p>

        <!-- Safety content placeholder -->
        <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 text-gray-700 rounded-lg p-6 text-center text-sm shadow-sm">
          <p class="font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-1">CSR Profile & Statistics Pending Official Approval</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-550">The detailed budget allocations and local development figures are currently undergoing official review.</p>
          <div class="mt-3 inline-block bg-neutral-200 text-neutral-800 px-3 py-1 rounded text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
            [Content Pending Approval]
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
